j T* () Tj T* (Note that there is a separate convention for builtin names: most builtin names are single words) Tj T* (\(or two words run together\), with the CapWords convention used only for exception names and) Tj T* (builtin constants.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Type Variable Names) Tj T* () Tj T* () Tj T* (Page 16 of 27) Tj T* ET
