BT /F1 10 Tf 13 TL 50 800 Td (PEP 8 Style Guide for Python Code) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (# Wrong:) Tj T* (if foo[:3] == 'bar':) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Object type comparisons should always use isinstance\(\) instead of) Tj T* (comparing types directly:) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (# Correct:) Tj T* (if isinstance\(obj, int\):) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (# Wrong:) Tj T* (if type\(obj\) is type\(1\):) Tj T* () Tj T* (- For sequences, \(strings, lists, tuples\), use the fact that empty) Tj T* (sequences are false:) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (# Correct:) Tj T* (if not seq:) Tj T* (if seq:) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (# Wrong:) Tj T* (if len\(seq\):) Tj T* (if not len\(seq\):) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Don't write string literals that rely on significant trailing) Tj T* (whitespace.  Such trailing whitespace is visually indistinguishable) Tj T* (and some editors \(or more recently, reindent.py\) will trim them.) Tj T* () Tj T* (- Don't compare boolean values to True or False using ==:) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (# Correct:) Tj T* (if greeting:) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (# Wrong:) Tj T* (if greeting == True:) Tj T* () Tj T* (Worse:) Tj T* () Tj T* (.. code-block:) Tj T* () Tj T* (Page 24 of 27) Tj T* ET
